{"about_the_game":"Just a usual day. You're heading out for a walk just like you do it every day. You're stepping out of your apartment when all of a sudden, you see a little girl who looks frightened. She asks to help her find her mother... <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693800/extras/f0f03d2a241196bfd61dfe12f5ff2f81.poster.avif?t=1772625918\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693800/extras/f0f03d2a241196bfd61dfe12f5ff2f81.webm?t=1772625918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693800/extras/f0f03d2a241196bfd61dfe12f5ff2f81.mp4?t=1772625918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From now on everything goes beyond normal. You are trapped in a nightmare that is taking place in this dwelling. But don't even try to escape - you have to help this girl.<br>In this game, you will face paranormal creepy things that you need to defeat on your way to freedom. Meet terrifying tenants of your house... Are they friends or foes? Are you brave enough to find out the little girl's story and find her mother? Hardcore gameplay, challenging puzzles, ominous atmosphere and constant sense of foreboding are waiting for you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693800/extras/1624a99160fb9fb287715f692785d1fd.poster.avif?t=1772625918\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693800/extras/1624a99160fb9fb287715f692785d1fd.webm?t=1772625918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693800/extras/1624a99160fb9fb287715f692785d1fd.mp4?t=1772625918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Solve all the mysteries, reveal all the stories playing as a single player, or with your friend in co-op.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693800/extras/abc6a331111865d4c7a4c35852aa5855.poster.avif?t=1772625918\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693800/extras/abc6a331111865d4c7a4c35852aa5855.webm?t=1772625918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693800/extras/abc6a331111865d4c7a4c35852aa5855.mp4?t=1772625918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Our other projects: P R O T O C O L  and Startup Valley Adventure - Episode 1<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693800/extras/848527f156d17beef97e45d2ce984ead.avif?t=1772625918\" width=615 height=176 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"778c14c1aafbd58aa7d2c7f66d56edcb25f7e7ba.jpg","localized_name":"Dear Granny","name":"Dear Granny","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/693800/778c14c1aafbd58aa7d2c7f66d56edcb25f7e7ba.jpg"},{"icon":"a48e6b0f7a0e4ee705fe6af6215885bc8eb88a8f.jpg","localized_name":"Peek-a-boo","name":"Peek-a-boo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/693800/a48e6b0f7a0e4ee705fe6af6215885bc8eb88a8f.jpg"},{"icon":"9894fd19d231630d7ba1914255fc3c478e09b4a5.jpg","localized_name":"Here's Johnny!","name":"Here's Johnny!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/693800/9894fd19d231630d7ba1914255fc3c478e09b4a5.jpg"},{"icon":"5911071f426efe8d1de51949545bbd448b0e6cc9.jpg","localized_name":"Mr. Saw","name":"Mr. Saw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/693800/59